    "chunk_text": "1. Of the 116 hectares leased to the China Harbour Engineering Company (Pvt.) Limited, what extent has been sub-leased or otherwise transferred to date? Will the Government table a list of the investors, the country of ownership of each and the duration of each lease? Further, overall, what proportion of the land is utilized by Sri Lanka-based companies? 2. What has the Government earned from the Port City to date compared to what the China Harbour Engineering Company (Pvt.) Limited has earned from marketing land in the Zone? 3. For each of the past five years, how much foreign investment was actually received (a) within the Port City and (b) through the Board of Investment and other channels in US dollars? This question is about how much of investment the Port City has brought in and how much of investment the Board of Investment has brought in. 4. How many people work in the Port City today - how many Sri Lankan citizens, how many under 35 years of age and how many foreign nationals? Hon. Minister Anil Jayantha, I would also like to share with you an article that appeared on 13th April, 2021. \u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf\u0daf\u200d\u0dba\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dc0\u0dc3\u0db1\u0daf\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dbb\u0db4\u0dda\u0dc3 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0dbb\u0dda\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dc3\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\u0dae\u0db1\u0d9a\u0da7\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dc5\u0dc0\u0dca\u200d\u0dba\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0dda\u0dca\u0dc3\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\u0dae\u0db1\u0d9a\u0dda\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dc4\u0dca \u0dda\u0dca .\u0dc3When the Port City Economic Commission was gazetted, Colombo Port City Economic Commission \u0d91 \u0dc3\u0d9c \u0dca\u0da8\u0dcf\u0dc3 \u0dbd\u0daf\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dae\u0dcf\u0daf\u0db4\u0db1\u0d9a\u0dc3 \u0db1\u0dda \u0daf\u0da7\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dd2\u0dc5\u0dc3\u0dc0\u0dca\u200d\u0daf\u0dda \u0dcf\u0dc3\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dc3\n\n625 626\n\n\u0db4\u0daf\u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dda\u0dca\u0dca \u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dc0\u0dca\u200d\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf\u0daf\u200d\u0dba\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dc0\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dc4\u0db1\u0dc3\u0dc3\u0d8a\u0dc5\u0dd9\u0dc3\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\u0dae\u0db1\u0d9a\u0dc3\u0dda\u0dca \u0dba\u0dd2. 5. For the past five years, state separately the total expenditure of the Board of Investment and the Colombo Port City Economic Commission - including but not limited to salaries and wages and capital expenditure - their self-generated revenue and Treasury funding and the amount to generate per US dollar of investment actually received."
